# Route rollover — the race (route A), throttle held until the car runs off the end of the straight and hits the barrier at a slant
# (a hard side impact: the mod logs a lateral velocity change of ~8 m/s in one physics step, normal driving is ~0.2), then throttle again
# (840 vblanks) and brake (300): the car tumbles, settles and drives on. For tools/mod_rollover_check.sh. This is `reset.pad` without its
# SELECT item (the reset check's quiet run); with `reset.pad` itself the reset-to-track mod fires while the car is still rolling.
# Timeline (measured 2026-11-08, `--decomp off`): race start at player-car step ~750, the barrier hit at step ~1852.
# Pages: see chase.pad.
